% \end{equation}
where $\hat{f}_{\tau}:{X} \times {U} \rightarrow \textit{X}$ represents the transition map of the high-fidelity simulator model, which is unknown. For brevity, the $f_{\tau}$ and $\hat{f}_{\tau}$ will be represented as $f$ and $\hat{f}$ in the further discussions.
