We now outline our main contributions.


\begin{enumerate}
    \item We identify the cover learning problem as a general purpose unsupervised learning problem.
          We observe that several methods from TDA are in essence cover learning algorithms, and review their strengths and limitations (\cref{section:cover-learning-algorithms}).

