% Correlation coefficients between ${{\bm{f}}_G}$ and various variables are computed, as detailed in TABLE.~\ref{tab:relate}.
% The result, ${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{f}}_G},{\bm{N}_{base}}\left( 1 \right)} \right] = 0.0054$, indicates a lack of correlation between ${{\bm{f}}_G}$ and the tilt angle $\delta $.


In MAT.Part.4.2 \cite{groundeffectgithub}, correlation coefficients between ${{\bm{f}}_G}$ and various variables are computed: ${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{f}}_G},{\bm{N}_{base}}\left( 1 \right)} \right] = 0.0054$, indicates a lack of correlation between ${{\bm{f}}_G}$ and the tilt angle $\delta $.

