\subsection{Mixing Matrix Model under Ground Effect}
\label{subsec:bodytorque}




% 地面效应对动力学模型产生了各种影响。我们有理由怀疑，旋翼转速差产生的扭矩模型也会受到地面效应的影响。混控矩阵的部分参数可能随四旋翼的状态而变化。为此，我们展开实物实验进行了验证。
Ground effect has various impacts on the dynamic model of the quadrotor.
We have reasons to suspect that the torque generated by rotor speed differences is also affected by ground effect, which means some parameters of the mixing control matrix in (\ref{equ_mixmatrix}) (${k_{TX}},{k_{TY}},{k_I}$) may vary with the state of the quadrotor.
Therefore, we conduct experiments to validate this.

% 我们将无人机固定在测力平台上，保持地面水平，调节无人机到地面的距离（图1a~c），使得4个电机以不同的转速转动，并采集电机转速和传感器的扭矩数据。
We fix the quadrotor onto the platform (Fig.~\ref{fig_model_valid}(b$\sim$d)) and adjust the distance between the quadrotor and the ground board while ensuring the ground board is level.
Then we drive the four rotors to rotate at varying speeds.
Data on rotor speeds, heights and torques are collected.


% 地板相对于无人机y轴是可调的，且存在一定的调节误差，无法保证地板完全水平，传感器y轴上依然存在水平力矩。因此在研究推力差产生的力矩时，我们只关注X轴和Z轴（KTX和KI）。
The ground board is adjustable relative to the quadrotor's Y-axis, with a certain adjustment error that prevents the ground board from being perfectly level.
The leveling torque still exists on the Y-axis.
Therefore, when studying the torque generated by thrust difference, we only focus on the X-axis and Z-axis (${k_{TX}}, {k_I}$).

% -----------------------------------------------------------------


% In TABLE.~\ref{tab:relate}, it can be seen that the body torque ${{\bm{\tau }}_B}$ is closely related to the rotor speed difference ${\bm{N}_{base}}$ and has no relationship with the altitude $h$. For example, ${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{x}}_W}^ \top {{\bm{\tau }}_B},{\bm{N}_{base}}\left( 2 \right)} \right] = 0.8400$, ${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{x}}_W}^ \top {{\bm{\tau }}_B},h} \right] =  - 0.0937$.

We calculate the Spearman correlation coefficient in MAT.Part.4.2 \cite{groundeffectgithub}:
${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{x}}_W}^ \top {{\bm{\tau }}_B},{\bm{N}_{base}}\left( 2 \right)} \right] = 0.8400$, ${r_s}\left[ {{{\bm{x}}_W}^ \top {{\bm{\tau }}_B},h} \right] =  - 0.0937$.
It can be seen that the body torque ${{\bm{\tau }}_B}$ is closely related to the rotor speed difference ${\bm{N}_{base}}$ and has no relationship with the altitude $h$.

% -----------------------------------------------------------------




% 我们分别计算了各个系数（KXKYKTKI）与高度的关系，如图2所示。图中的系数是经过如下归一化的：

We calculate the relationship between each coefficient (${k_{T}}$, ${k_{TX}}$ and ${k_I}$) and the altitude respectively in Fig.~\ref{fit_bodytorque}.
The coefficients in the figure are normalized with the following procedure:

\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
\label{equ_knorm}
    \bar k\left( h \right) = \frac{{k\left( h \right)}}{{k\left( { + \infty } \right)}} - 1.
\end{aligned}
\end{equation}



% 图1中，当无人机从高空下降到近地面，由无人机转速差产生的力矩系数变化不大（不到10%），相对于推力系数的变化（30%）很小。


In Fig.~\ref{fit_bodytorque}, as the quadrotor descends from high altitude to the ground board, the change in torque coefficient ($k_{TX}$ and $k_{I}$) generated by the rotor speed difference is negligible (less than 10\%), compared to the change in thrust coefficient $k_T$ (around 30\%).



% 我们认为这种变化主要是由靠近地面时，机械结构震动大，测量有误差导致的。可以认为混控矩阵的扭矩参数不受地面效应的影响。

We believe this change is mainly caused by the mechanical vibrations near the ground, leading to measurement errors.


\noindent
\textbf{\emph{Conclusion 2:}}

\textbf
{
    The torque parameters of the mixing control matrix ($k_{TX} , k_{TX} , k_{I}$) remains \emph{unaffected} by ground effect.
}



