\section{Discussion and future work}
\label{sec:conclusion}

% 本文汇总了在地面效应下的无人机动力学模型，并形成了一套控制方法。我们考虑了地面效应的推力、回正力矩、rotor drag模型，也验证了地面效应对于混控矩阵的影响。但是我们有几个方面还有不足之处。
% 第一点是没有对高速前向飞行时的推力衰减进行建模。这主要有两个原因，第一是我们的标定方式一般是静态的测力支架，第二是我们的飞行速度达不到能产生明显衰减的阈值。在我们的飞行中，由于近地飞行的速度不超过悬停诱导速度4m/s，且最小飞行高度大于桨叶半径，导致了升力衰减不明显。
% 但是从表格1中可以看到，高速飞行确实对z轴控制效果产生了一定的影响。
% 第二点是对rotor drag的衰减研究的不够透彻。rotor drag的成因已经涉及到比较复杂的气流现象，而地面效应的加入使得情况更加复杂。
% 我们希望在以后的研究中可以逐一解决这些问题。



This paper summarizes various models of the multicopter under ground effect and establishes a control methodology. We consider the additional thrust, leveling torque, and rotor drag models under ground effect and validate its impact on the mixing matrix. However, our study has several limitations.
Firstly, we do not model the thrust decrease during high-speed forward flight\cite{kan2019analysis}. This is mainly due to two reasons: our models are primarily calibrated at static force platforms, and our flight speed does not reach the threshold that would produce a significant loss of lift.
In our flight scenarios, the flight speed remains below the induced speed of $4m/s$, and the minimum flight altitude is larger than the propeller radius, resulting in the lift reduction being not obvious and, therefore, not considered.
However, Exp.6 and Exp.7 in TABLE.~\ref{tab:ctrl} indicate that high-speed flight impacts the control effectiveness along the Z-axis.
Secondly, our study on the decrease of rotor drag is not thorough enough. The causes of rotor drag involve complex airflow phenomena \cite{bristeau2009role}, and the ground effect further complicates the situation. We hope that future research will explain this phenomenon clearly.

