&=\mathbb{E}_{z(U,\Lambda) \sim q_{T-t}}\bigg [ 
%
\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}U}  \bigg( (\nabla \varphi(z(U, \Lambda)))^\top \nabla_U \log q_{T-t|0}(z(U, \Lambda))\\
%
&\qquad \qquad \qquad \qquad \qquad \qquad+ \frac{1}{2}\mathrm{tr}(\nabla^2 \varphi(z(U, \Lambda)))\bigg) \mathbbm{1}_\Omega(\Lambda)  \bigg | V=U \bigg]\\
%
&\qquad +\mathbb{E}_{z(U,\Lambda) \sim q_{T-t}}\bigg [  
