Among the parameter sets with $3 \leq r, c \leq 20$ and $\max(r, c) \leq v \leq rc$, there are just 12 for which the inequality~\eqref{eq:dual_bd} does not hold.
We present these parameter sets in Table~\ref{tbl:nonta_dual_bd}.
