Beyond logic modeling and Formal Methods, there is a rich line of web-based tools that support programming education.
%
Online interactive textbooks like Stepik~\cite{stepik2023} and Runestone~\cite{ericson2020runestone} let students learn programming concepts and complete programming practices in the browser.
%
There are also various programming environments covering a broad range of topics.
