        Compared to debugging algorithmic code, debugging logic modeling code has been a hard problem~\cite{goualard1999visualization, leo2017debugging}, but part of it could be mitigated with appropriate editor support for getting the syntax correct and avoid \emph{``the [output] given to the students [not being] straightforward''} (P6).
