\section{Design of \tool}\label{sec:design}

We designed \tool, a web-based tool for the education of logic modeling with the Z3 SMT solver~\cite{DBLP:conf/tacas/MouraB08} that is scalable, student-centered, and extensible, addressing all design guidelines (\autoref{sec:design-goals-of-tool}) except \textbf{D2}.
