\begin{lemma}\label{NewLemma1}
For each $i,j=1,\ldots,m$, there is a constant $c>0$ such that the following inequalities hold for any times $t_l,t_{l+1}\in[\sigma_b,\sigma_{b+1}]$ with $t_l < t_{l+1}$:
