corresponds to  $F(U^m,U^{m-1}) = f(U^{m-1}) + S\,(U^m -U^{m-1})$
%or $F(v,w):=f(w)+S\,(v-w)$,
with a sufficiently large stabilization parameter $S$,
and a second-order explicit scheme with
$f(U^m)$ approximated by $f(U^{m-1}+\tau_m\delta_t U^{m-1})$ \cite{Plociniczak24}.
