$F_H(x)=B_{m_1,m_2}(\mh{x}$, where 
\[ B_{p,q}(x)\triangleq \frac{\Gamma(p+q)}{\Gamma(p)\Gamma(q)} \int_0^x t^{p-1}(1-t)^{q-1}\dd t, \quad x\in[0,1] ,\]
