System model is discussed in Section \ref{sectionsystemmodel}. The formulations for optimal static and optimal dynamic bandwidth sharing policies are briefed in Section \ref{Od OS}. Section \ref{sectionsemisharing} presents the proposed semi-static bandwidth sharing policy. Simulation results are in Section \ref{sectionperformanceevaluation}.
