ABS meets the long-term minimum-quality constraint \eqref{approx of expectation} using a virtual queue $ P_{r,n}^{i}(k)$ associated with \eqref{approx of expectation}. This queue serves to monitor the deficit a client experiences in meeting the requirement specified by \eqref{approx of expectation}.
