In each period $k$, ABS carries out scheduling (i.e., deciding $\bm{\tau}$) by optimizing
\begin{align}
  & F_k(\bm{\tau},\bm{P}(k))  =  - V \sum_{r \in \mathcal {R}} \sum_{i\in \mathcal O}\sum_{{n} \in {\mathcal N}^{i}_{r}}  Q \left(\tau^{i}_{r,n}(k) \right)A^{i}_{r,n}(k)  \nonumber \\
